      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Isostructural complexes 1–4 were obtained by solvothermal reaction of [Mn6O2(Piv)10(4-Me-Py)2.5(PivH)1.5] (0.05 mmol) with Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (0.1 mmol; Ln = La for 1), NEt3 (0.5 mmol) and teaH3 (0.5 mmol) in MeCN–MeOH (2 : 1 v/v, 15 mL) at 120 °C, giving colorless prism crystals. Unit-cell determinations, IR, CHN, and ICP confirmed 1–4 to be isostructural; the full crystal structure was solved only for 3.",
