      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Dc susceptibility (2–300 K, 0.1 T) for 1 is consistent with three Mn(II) ions and diamagnetic La(III). Weak ferromagnetic Mn(II)–Mn(II) coupling is indicated by a slight high-T rise in χmT, with a small low-T decrease attributed to ZFS/Zeeman effects. MAGPACK fit above 50 K gave J = 0.2013 cm−1 and g = 1.99.",
        "measurements": [
